  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth mobility, food security and rural poverty reduction: Fostering rural diversification through enhanced youth employment and better labour mobility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Programme is structured around three Outcomes : br  1) Improved knowledge and awareness on how to harness the potential of migration and economic mobility to promote youth employement in agriculture. br  2)Improved policy coherence to better manage rural migration and facilitate opportunities for rural use in agriculture through seasonal migration and agro-entrepreneurship in Tunisia. br  3) Improved policy coherence to better manage rural migration and facilitate opportunities for rural use in agriculture through seasonal migration and agro-entrepreneurship in Ethiopia.</narrative>
  </description>
